silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_01_concrete_anchor_4#visitdate2026_04_12 silm:hasLongDescription "The VisitDate2026_04_12 is the 2026-04-12 timestamp. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Date2026_04_12', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
